notes.content:
[h1]Gameplay[/h1]
[list]
[*] Added 5 new treasures;
[*] Added new summon: Black Hole;
[*] Introduced an exclusive infinite mode monster (spawns only in Infinite Challenge);
[*] Reworked treasure "Diamond Pickaxe": "1. Damage to Brick 100%, 2. For every 2% of your Damage to Brick, Damage to Monster +1%";
[*] Freeze effect rebalance: Now also slows enemy movement skills;
[*] AI upgrades: Normal monsters now exhibit more aggressive attack patterns;
[/list]
[h1]Art[/h1]
[list]
[*] Completely revamped freeze VFX for monsters;
[/list]
[h1]Audio[/h1]
[list]
[*] New thrust sound effects for the "Spear" summon;
[/list]
[h1]Program[/h1]
[list]
[*] Performance boost: Optimized multiple VFX
[*] Dynamic UI scaling: Item effect text now auto-adjusts to fit container size;Gameplay

[h1]Gameplay[/h1]
[list]
[*] New button of "Finish Game" was added into system panel when player in infinite level;
[*] New treasure of "Scabbard" was added & New minion of "The Sword" was added;
[*] Increased the attack speed of "Spear";
[*] Increased the damage caused by the reflect bullet of the minion "Petal";
[/list]
[h1]BUG[/h1]
[list]
[*] Fixed a issue where minion may exceed the level limit;
[*] Fixed a issue where sacrifices cannot drop special treasures;
[/list]

[h1]Gameplay[/h1]
[list]
[*] Support changing volume in battle settings;
[*] The effect of the treasure "Pen" has changed from "Fire Range -10%" to "Fire Range -10%"
[*] The reward chest in the first level can only obtain up to 4 treasures;
[/list]
[h1]Art[/h1]
[list]
[*] Optimized the effects of the treasure chest, now there will be better performance in the "Infinite" mode;
[*] Add blinking material effects to the wings of the Monster Judge;
[/list]
[h1]BUG[/h1]
[list]
[*] Fixed the issue where the smithing table cannot interact again after exiting;
[*] Fixed the issue of incorrect display of unlocking the Hero "Rocky";
[/list]

[h1]Gameplay[/h1]
[list]
[*] Change the key binding and mouse sensitivity during battles are supported;
[*] Slightly increased the health growth of normal and elite monsters;
[*] Slightly increased the explosion radius for players to cause explosions;
[*] Add a treasure "jam" to the initial hero;
[/list]
[h1]Art[/h1]
[list]
[*] Added sky sphere and volume cloud effects;
[*] Remade the models of grassland and vegetation;
[*] Remade the terrain model;
[*] Optimized level lighting;
[*] Redraw some widgets in the main menu;
[/list]
[h1]Other[/h1]
[list]
[*] Fixed some text errors in English localization;
[*] Fixed an error that occurred when players opened the weapon chests when they were full of weapons;
[/list]

[olist]
[*] Further optimized lighting and optimized the material of some terrain bricks;
[*] After obtaining the treasure through the ancients, a pop-up panel will appear;
[*] When monsters are spawned, collisions with players will not cause damage;
[*] The price for purchasing "Golden Carrot Potion" in the shop has been adjusted to 120 coins;
[*] Partial English text optimization;
[/olist]

[h1]Only for demo version[/h1]
[h2] Arts [/h2]
[list]
[*] Remade the game logo on the menu panel;
[*] Remade all UI widgets on the battle panel and unify the panel's color scheme;
[*] Remade the texture of most of the terrain bricks and optimized the material performance;
[*] Optimized the lighting performance of some levels to avoid overexposure;
[*] Remade some font colors and styles to make the UI more suitable;
[/list]
[h2] Gameplay [/h2]
[list]
[*] After upgrading, players will not immediately open the treasure selection panel, but will open after playing effects;
[*] Added level icons in the interactive panel of the portal;
[*] When the player is healed, play a health healing sound effect;
[*] Slightly shrunk the player's collision box;
[*] Slightly increased the movement speed of some monsters;
[/list]
[h2] Program [/h2]
[list]
[*] Optimized the serialization of the archive system (which may cause inability to use historical battle archives);
[*] Version name rules revised;
[/list]
[h2] BUG [/h2]
[list]
[*] Fixed a bug where some treasures could not appear on the treasure selection panel；
[/list]

[h1]Only for official version[/h1]
[h2] Arts [/h2]
[list]
[*] Remade all UI widgets of the main battle HUD;
[*] Remade the texture of most of the terrain bricks;
[*] Optimized the lighting performance of some levels to avoid excessive brightness;
[*] Remade font colors and styles to make the UI more suitable;
[/list]
[h2] Gameplay [/h2]
[list]
[*] After upgrading, players will not immediately open the treasure selection panel, but will open after playing effects;
[*] Slightly reduced the player's collision box;
[*] When the player's health is healed, add a health healing sound effect;
[/list]
[h2] Program [/h2]
[list]
[*] Added framework support for minion system;
[*] New treasure has been added for testing minion system;
[*] Optimized the serialization of the archive system (which may result in the unavailability of historical battle archives);
[*] Version name rules revised;
[/list]

[list]
[*] Fixed a bug where the BOSS chest cannot refresh valid treasures when luck is less than 0;
[*] Optimize player operations of the item selection panel;
[/list]
